<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - June 1.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - June 1.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Sunday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>BAHRAIN TRIBUNE</p>
<p>- Foreign ministers of the six-nation Gulf Cooperation Council call on Turkey to withdraw its troops from Iraq.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Bahrain's top 10 industries spent nearly 7.4 million dinars on training their Bahraini staff.</p>
<p>AL-AYAM</p>
<p>- Iran confirms its intention to boost relations with Bahrain.</p>
<p>AKHBAR AL-KHALEEJ</p>
<p>- Bahrain developing the tourism sector, prime minister says.</p>
</text>
